 * The quote step a claim is filed against. Today this ASSUMES the referenced
 * index holds a quote: nothing has forced the assumption to be checked yet, and
 * a claim naming a non-quote step fails here with an opaque undefined-property
 * error rather than a rejection.
 *
 * The assumption is isolated in this function on purpose. The pending
 * error-handling tests ("a claim for an item not part of the policy", "a claim
 * with a damage entry of an unknown item type") are what will force a real
 * rejection, and this is the single place that has to change when they do.
